================================================================================
SCOPE NOTE FOR THIS REPOSITORY
================================================================================

This repository contains a methodology, written guidance, reference knowledge
and supporting scripts for producing long-form static advertising creative.

What the license covers:
  - The written methodology, knowledge base, phase prompts and documentation.
  - The accompanying Python scripts as published here.

What this license does NOT grant:
  - Permission to run this methodology as a paid service for third parties.
  - Permission to publish a modified or derived version of this methodology,
    under this name or another.
  - Any right to the trademarks, brand names or product names of any company.

If you want to use this commercially, or to publish a derivative, you need
separate written permission from the copyright holder.

